  "details": "I tend to send and accept friend invites pretty freely, but that can sometimes backfire when it turns out I'm not very comfortable with someone. I don't want to be mean and unfriend them because we have mutual friends, but I also want to have boundaries organically made clear without really having to explicitly talk about it. So I'd like nametags to say \"Favorite Friend\" if you and the other person are both on each other's favorite friends lists.",
